        },
        {
            "_id": "bd5fpgu3trmh7764",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Eat Soul",
            "sort": 1500000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The queen touches a dying creature or a creature that died within the past 1 hour with her proboscis. If the target is dying, it must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:41] save; on a failure, its dying value increases by 2 (3 on a critical failure). If the target is dead, the queen automatically devours its soul. Unless the queen is destroyed, the target can't be returned to life through any means, even powerful magic such as a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wish] ritual.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
